        en: { name: 'Colchis Fountain', description: 'A fountain on the central square with gilded copies of Colchian artefacts, ringed by the handsome theatre and old buildings.', tip: 'Shoot in the evening when the lights come on and the gold figures gleam. Stand at the fountain’s edge facing the theatre, as locals do.' },
